  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">To count the days between two dates manually, subtract the earlier date from the later one. This sounds simple but becomes complicated when months have different lengths or when a leap year falls within the range. Our calculator handles all of this automatically. Some quick examples:</p>
  <ul style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:2;padding-left:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
