  <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0.5rem">Does the calculator account for leap years?</h2>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8">Yes. A leap year occurs every four years and has 366 days instead of 365, with the extra day on 29 February. Our calculator automatically accounts for leap years in any date range, giving you a perfectly accurate result regardless of how many leap years fall within your selected period.</p>
